espond to a localized structural abnormality.\n\n**X-AI**\n- **Confidence interpretation:** the system reports very high confidence, but also explicitly notes this is **not a definitive diagnostic tool**\n- **Summary:** the pipeline output suggests a **high likelihood of kidney tumor / kidney cancer pattern** in this image\n- **Visual evidence:** the system says it detected a renal tumor-like region\n- **Recommended next steps:**\n  1. Further medical evaluation with imaging/labs to confirm what this represents\n  2. Review with a medical professional\n  3. Consider additional diagnostic testing if needed, such as biopsy or other confirmatory workup\n\n**Important note**\nThis is a **preliminary signal, not an actual diagnosis**. A radiologist/urologist would still need to confirm the finding with proper clinical interpretation and formal imaging review.\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/b0f1c107-0576-49f4-985a-1754b3411728.jpeg\n\nIf you want, I can also give you:\n- a **patient-friendly explanation** of what this result means, or\n- a **clinical interpretation** of this CT appearance and the main differentials.\n\nSince you’ve now run a diagnostic tool, you can also use the **LLM Distillation** tool next to turn this result into a more comprehensive report with suggested next steps.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_00e75afa13aca8910169bbd3046624819191fec7c1d5f79ff3\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":10511,"output":525,"cacheRead":11776,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22812,"cost":{"input":0.026277500000000002,"output":0.007875,"cacheRead":0.002944,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.037096500000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773916927053}}
